	(text "Pixel clock: 18.432MHz / 3 = 6.144MHz, T = 0.16276us\nHsync: Low 32px, High: 352px, Total: 384px, f = 6.144MHz / 384 = 16kHz\nHBlank: Low 97px (Flipped 96), Front Porch: 32px, Back Porch: 32px,\n	    Active pixels: 384 - 97 = 287 (288 flipped)\n\nDiagram is for non-flipped timing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 33.02 0)
